      "leadImage": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1f/Teatro_de_San_Carlos%2C_N%C3%A1poles%2C_Italia%2C_2023-03-25%2C_DD_184-186_HDR.jpg/3840px-Teatro_de_San_Carlos%2C_N%C3%A1poles%2C_Italia%2C_2023-03-25%2C_DD_184-186_HDR.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail",
